{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "category": "Stairs",
 "source": "Dirkies fixtures_stairs_ddd_01 (Daddy Dirkie / Melos tiles). 7 stairs, each with E/W + N/S orientations (3 step sprites each, low->high). KBW stair model (kind:stairs; W face = vertical 3-row stack y:-2; N face = horizontal 3-sprite row). 3 of the 7 have a support pillar added as a 2nd face layer: teal metal uses ONE post (idx 30) on both orientations; grey and white use TWO posts (one per orientation: grey 38/46, white 54/62). dark metal + the 3 wood stairs have none. The BuildingMenu addon's hardcoded pillar offsets were WRONG against the art (idx 14/15 empty; wood offsets overlapped other stairs); posts were verified by pixel inspection (tall+narrow art at idx 30/38/46/54/62).",
